---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /games/
title: Games
description: "포스메이게임즈가 만든 게임들 — 고양이호텔, 달빛 개구리여관, 유령호텔 타이쿤"
---

<section class="page-head">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Games</p>
    <h1 class="h-xl">게임</h1>
    <p>아늑하고 따뜻한 세계에서 만나는 힐링 타이쿤</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:16px">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="game-grid">
      {% for g in games %}
      <a class="game-card" href="/{{ g.slug }}/" data-reveal>
        <div class="media ratio-16-9" data-label="{{ g.title }}">
          <img src="{{ g.thumb }}" alt="{{ g.title }}" loading="lazy" width="960" height="540">
        </div>
        <div class="game-card-body">
          <h3>{{ g.title }}</h3>
          <p class="en">{{ g.titleEn }}</p>
          <p>{{ g.tagline }}</p>
          <span class="badge{% if g.status == '출시' %} badge--live{% endif %}">{{ g.status }}</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
